WEBVTT

00:07:59.141 --> 00:08:01.644
We feel responsible for Mother Earth.

00:08:01.644 --> 00:08:03.187
So can all of you.

00:08:04.188 --> 00:08:07.316
Demonstrate the responsibility
through action.

00:08:07.316 --> 00:08:09.109
Do not be afraid to say:

00:08:09.151 --> 00:08:11.695
"I don't know, let's find out together."

00:08:14.156 --> 00:08:19.370
Attend activities hosted
by Indigenous communities.

00:08:19.828 --> 00:08:21.705
Lead by example.

00:08:22.790 --> 00:08:25.042
Talk about decolonizing

00:08:25.042 --> 00:08:29.213
and indigenizing education
with colleagues.

00:08:29.838 --> 00:08:34.093
Connect with Indigenous people,
businesspeople, artists,